  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n371 ÷ 16 = 23.1875\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nIf a ÷ b = c, then (a × 0.001) ÷ (b × 0.001) = c\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n0.00371 ÷ 0.016 = (371 ÷ 100000) ÷ (16 ÷ 1000)\n\n⇒ 0.00371 ÷ 0.016 = (371 ÷ 100000) ÷ (16 ÷ 1000)\n\n⇒ (371 ÷ 100000) × (1000 ÷ 16)\n\n⇒ (371 × 1000) ÷ (100000 × 16)\n\n⇒ 371000 ÷ 1600000\n\n⇒ 0.231875\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option 2.**",
